<title>THAILAND: Thai Financial Trust to issue debentures.</title>
<headline>Thai Financial Trust to issue debentures.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Financial Trust will issue unsecured subordinated debentures worth up to three billion baht, the company said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The debt issue, which will have a maturity not exceeding 10 years, is due to be approved by shareholders at a meeting on 27 March. Further details are to be decided closer to the issue date, the company said in a statement to the Thai stock exchange.</p>
</text>
